Review this Java code for security vulnerabilities:
```java
@GetMapping("/api/users/{id}/settings")
public Settings getUserSettings(@PathVariable Long id) {
    return settingsRepo.findByUserId(id);
}
```

output:
**Broken Access Control** (CWE-862) [HIGH]

Always verify the authenticated user owns the requested resource.

**Fixed:**
```java
@GetMapping("/api/users/{id}/settings")
public Settings getUserSettings(@PathVariable Long id, @AuthenticationPrincipal User user) {
    if (!user.getId().equals(id)) throw new AccessDeniedException("Forbidden");
    return settingsRepo.findByUserId(id);
}
```

