app.get("/redirect", (req, res) => {
  res.redirect(req.query.url);
});
```

output:
**Open Redirect** (CWE-601) [MEDIUM]

Validate redirect target matches the application host.

**Fixed:**
```javascript
app.get("/redirect", (req, res) => {
  const url = new URL(req.query.url, `${req.protocol}://${req.get("host")}`);
  if (url.host !== req.get("host")) return res.status(400).send("Invalid redirect");
  res.redirect(url.pathname);
});
```

